---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy — Files Stay in Your Browser | DocCheck" description="DocCheck processes your photo and signature files inside your browser. Nothing is uploaded to a server during the check-and-fix process. No accounts, no sign-up." canonical="https://doccheck.example/privacy/">
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="fineprint"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy</nav>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p><strong>Your files never leave your device during the core check-and-fix process.</strong> Reading, comparing, resizing, compressing and converting all happen in your browser with client-side code.</p>
    <p>There are no accounts and no sign-up, so there is nothing to tie a file to you. We run no advertising inside the core workflow and make no AI or API calls with your files.</p>
    <p>The only network requests are the ones your browser normally makes: loading the page itself and the fonts it uses.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
